From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:53:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 035/128] feat: tele launcher and settings icons

The launcher gets the tele ball as a full set of mipmaps plus an
adaptive icon (the ball cut out of the source over its own background
colour), and the tele settings section uses the bubble cut out of the
second image. The debug manifest points the application icon at the new
resources.

Confidence: high
Scope-risk: narrow
